    src   "A spin box whose hierarchy is code, not an asset.\n\nUSpinBox's pragmatic core: a number, a range, a step -- spelled as a row of three parts, [-] field\n[+], because that row is buildable from what the library already has. The step faces carry\nUIButton behaviours, the field carries UUITextInput hosting the value as culture-invariant text,\nand the CONTROL owns the number: buttons and submitted text are two roads into one\nclamp-assign-push-broadcast, so the field, the property and the event can never disagree about\nwhat the value is.\n\nEvery push into the parts is WithoutNotify -- writing authored state is not the user editing --\nand OnValueChanged fires exactly when the clamped value actually changes.\n\nDRAG TO SCRUB is the other half of USpinBox, and it needed no capture plumbing of its own in the\nend: UUITextInput already hands a drag UP when it is not being edited (its OnPointerBeginDrag\nreturns \"bubble\" unless bInputActive), so a drag that starts on an idle field arrives here as this\ncontrol's own NativeOnBeginDrag, and a drag inside a field the player is editing stays the text\nselection's. That is exactly the rule SSpinBox follows -- click to type, drag to scrub -- arrived\nat by asking who already owns the gesture rather than by inventing a mode.\n\nThe scrub sweeps MinSliderValue..MaxSliderValue (which default to the hard range) across the\ncontrol's own width, bent by SliderExponent so a large range can still be fine near one end. It\ncounts from where the drag was recognised, not from the press: the travel that turned the press\ninto a drag moves nothing, as in SSpinBox, so the value does not leap by the drag threshold the\nmoment a scrub starts.\n\nTHE ARROW KEYS step it, as SSpinBox::OnKeyDown does: with the focus anywhere in the control and the\nfield not being edited, Up and Right add one step and Down and Left take one away, committed at once.\nThe step is StepSize, whatever modifier is held; with StepSize at zero it is SSpinBox's default step\n-- a tenth across a drag range of ten or less, one across a wider one -- times Shift's ten, Shift+Alt's\nhundred, Ctrl's tenth or Ctrl+Alt's hundredth. A stepped value stays inside the range a drag sweeps and\nlands on the StepSize grid. The four keys are the control's while it has the focus: they never take the\nfocus on to a neighbour, as they do not in UMG. The pad's D-pad is not among them and still navigates,\nand in a field being edited the arrows are the field's and move its caret.\n\n    /Script/DreamGUIControls.DreamSpinBox Count {\n        Value = 5\n        MaxValue = 10\n        OnValueChanged -> HandleCount\n    }"
    text  "一个层级由代码而非资产构建的数值微调框。\n\nUSpinBox务实的内核：一个数字、一个范围、一个步长——写成由三部分构成的一行：[-] 输入框\n[+]，因为这一行用库中已有的东西就能搭出来。步进的两端承载\nUIButton行为，输入框承载UUITextInput，以与区域性无关的文本承载该值，\n而数字归控件所有：按钮和提交的文本是通往同一套\n钳制-赋值-推送-广播的两条路，因此输入框、属性和事件对\n值的认识永远不会出现分歧。\n\n每次向这些部件推送都走WithoutNotify——写入编辑器状态并不等于用户编辑——\n而OnValueChanged只在钳制后的值真正发生变化时才触发。\n\n拖动擦洗是USpinBox的另一半，它最终并不需要自己的\n捕获逻辑：UUITextInput在未被编辑时本来就会把拖动向上传递（其OnPointerBeginDrag\n除非bInputActive否则返回\"bubble\"），因此在空闲输入框上开始的拖动会作为本\n控件自己的NativeOnBeginDrag抵达这里，而玩家正在编辑的输入框内的拖动仍然归文本\n选择所有。这正是SSpinBox遵循的规则——单击输入、拖动擦洗——它是\n通过追问谁已经拥有这一手势得出的，而不是靠发明一种模式。\n\n擦洗在控件自身的宽度上扫过MinSliderValue..MaxSliderValue（二者默认取硬性范围），\n并由SliderExponent弯曲，使大范围在某一端附近仍能保持精细。它\n从识别出拖动的位置开始计算，而不是从按下开始：把按下\n变成拖动的那段位移不产生任何移动，与SSpinBox中一样，因此值不会因拖动阈值而在\n擦洗刚开始时跳变。\n\n方向键可以步进它，与SSpinBox::OnKeyDown一样：焦点在控件内任意位置且\n输入框未被编辑时，上、右加一步，下、左减一步，并立即提交。\n无论按住哪个修饰键，步长都是StepSize；当StepSize为零时，则取SSpinBox的默认步长\n——拖动范围为十或更小时为十分之一，超过十时为1——再乘以Shift的十、Shift+Alt的\n一百、Ctrl的十分之一或Ctrl+Alt的百分之一。步进后的值仍保持在拖动所扫过的范围内，并\n落在StepSize网格上。这四个键在控件拥有焦点时归控件所有：它们绝不会把\n焦点移给相邻控件，在UMG中也是如此。手柄的十字键不在此列，仍用于导航，\n而在正在编辑的输入框中，方向键归输入框所有，用于移动光标。\n\n    /Script/DreamGUIControls.DreamSpinBox Count {\n        Value = 5\n        MaxValue = 10\n        OnValueChanged -> HandleCount\n    }"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:bAlwaysUsesDeltaSnap {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:bAlwaysUsesDeltaSnap
    src   "Every value, however it arrived, snapped to a multiple of StepSize -- UMG's AlwaysUsesDeltaSnap.\nOff (the default), only the step faces and the arrow keys move in whole steps -- an arrow key onto\nthe StepSize grid, as SSpinBox snaps an arrow-key commit to Delta -- and a drag or a typed value is free."
    text  "所有值无论以何种方式得到，都吸附到StepSize的整数倍——即UMG的AlwaysUsesDeltaSnap。\n关闭（默认）时，只有步进按钮和方向键按整步移动——方向键会落到\nStepSize网格上，正如SSpinBox把方向键提交吸附到Delta——而拖动或输入的值不受限制。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:bClearKeyboardFocusOnCommit {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:bClearKeyboardFocusOnCommit
    src   "Stop editing the field when the value is committed -- UMG's ClearKeyboardFocusOnCommit."
    text  "值提交后停止编辑输入框——即UMG的ClearKeyboardFocusOnCommit。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:bEnableSlider {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:bEnableSlider
    src   "Whether dragging the field scrubs the value at all -- UMG's EnableSlider."
    text  "拖动输入框是否擦洗值——即UMG的EnableSlider。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:bOverride_MinSliderValue {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:bOverride_MinSliderValue
    src   "The range the DRAG sweeps, which is not always the range the value may take -- UMG's\nMinSliderValue / MaxSliderValue, and its override pair.\n\nUnticked (the default) the scrub sweeps MinValue..MaxValue. Ticked, it sweeps this instead,\nwhich is what makes an unbounded-ish field draggable at all: a value that may legally be\nanything from 0 to 1000000 cannot be scrubbed across 200 pixels, but the 0..100 a player\nactually wants can be, with the rest still reachable by typing."
    text  "拖动所扫过的范围，它并不总是值可以取的范围——即UMG的\nMinSliderValue / MaxSliderValue及其重载对。\n\n未勾选（默认）时，擦洗扫过MinValue..MaxValue。勾选后，改为扫过这里的范围，\n这正是让近似无界的输入框能够被拖动的原因：一个合法取值可以是\n0到1000000之间任何数的值，无法在200像素内擦洗，但玩家\n真正想要的0..100可以，其余部分仍可通过输入到达。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:bOverride_MinValue {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:bOverride_MinValue
    src   "Whether the value HAS a bottom -- UMG's bOverride_MinValue, and the half of a range this\ncontrol could not say.\n\nTicked (the default, and what every existing spin box does) the value is clamped into\nMinValue..MaxValue. Unticked, that end is open: a field that may hold any negative number is a\nthing a settings screen genuinely wants, and before this the only way to spell it was a very\nlarge number that still was not \"no limit\"."
    text  "值是否有下界——即UMG的bOverride_MinValue（最小值重载），以及本控件\n此前无法表达的那一半范围。\n\n勾选（默认，也是所有现有数值微调框的做法）时，值被钳制在\nMinValue..MaxValue内。未勾选时，该端是开放的：一个可以保存任意负数的输入框\n确实是设置界面真正需要的东西，而在本次改动之前，表达这一点的唯一办法是填一个\n仍然不等于“无限制”的极大数。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:bSelectAllTextOnCommit {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:bSelectAllTextOnCommit
    src   "Select the whole number when the value is committed, ready to be typed over.\nTRUE here where UMG's is false: a spin box is filled in one entry after another and this is\nwhat it has always done."
    text  "值提交后选中整个数字，以便直接重新输入。\n此处为true，而UMG中为false：数值微调框是一个接一个地填写的，\n它一直就是这样做的。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:bSliderMoving {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:bSliderMoving
    src   "True while a drag is scrubbing. Transient: a scrub is a live gesture."
    text  "拖动正在擦洗时为true。瞬时：擦洗是一个实时手势。"
