DreamSpinBox:GetDelta {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:GetDelta
    src   "UMG's name for StepSize. One implementation, two spellings, no second truth."
    text  "UMG 对 StepSize 的称呼。同一个实现，两种写法，没有第二种事实。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:GetFont {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:GetFont
    src   "The typeface the number is drawn with -- UMG's Font, minus what FSlateFontInfo packs in beside\nit: the size is Style.FontSize and the outline belongs to the text style. Reads and writes\nStyle.Font, so it obeys StyleSource like the rest of the look, and null means \"leave the\nparagraph on the font it has\", which is every spin box that exists today."
    text  "绘制数字所用的字体——即 UMG 的字体，但不含 FSlateFontInfo 一并打包的其余内容：\n字号是 Style.FontSize，描边归文本样式所有。读取和写入\nStyle.Font，因此与外观的其他部分一样遵循 StyleSource；null 表示“让段落沿用\n其现有字体”，如今的每个数值微调框都是如此。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:GetMinValue {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:GetMinValue
    src   "The RANGE, in UMG's shape: a bound is a value plus whether there is one at all.\n\nGet returns the numeric limit rather than the stored number when the bound is off, because\nthat is what \"no minimum\" means to every caller that then clamps with it -- including this\ncontrol's own value road, which reads these two and nothing else."
    text  "范围，采用UMG的形式：一个边界是数值，外加是否存在该边界。\n\n边界关闭时，Get返回的是数值极限而非存储的数字，因为\n对于随后用它做钳制的每个调用方——“无最小值”就是这个意思——包括此\n控件自身的取值路径，它只读取这两个值，别的都不读。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:GetSliderMinValue {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:GetSliderMinValue
    src   "The bottom of the range a DRAG sweeps: MinSliderValue when overridden, MinValue otherwise."
