DreamSpinBox:MinDesiredWidth {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:MinDesiredWidth
    src   "A floor under the width the control asks a content-sized parent for -- UMG's MinDesiredWidth.\nZero means no opinion, which is every spin box that exists today."
    text  "控件向按内容调整大小的父级所请求宽度的下限——即 UMG 的 MinDesiredWidth。\n零表示不作要求，如今的每个数值微调框都是如此。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:MinFractionalDigits {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:MinFractionalDigits
    src   "How the number is SPELLED -- UMG's MinFractionalDigits / MaxFractionalDigits.\n\nAt least Min digits after the point and at most Max, trailing zeros past Min trimmed. Without\nthem the field printed the shortest spelling that reads back exactly, so a currency field\nshowed \"2.5\" where it meant \"2.50\" and a count field showed \"3\" beside \"3.0000001\"."
    text  "数字的书写方式——即 UMG 的 MinFractionalDigits / MaxFractionalDigits。\n\n小数点后至少 Min 位、至多 Max 位，超出 Min 的尾随零会被去掉。没有它们时，字段\n打印的是能精确读回的最短写法，于是货币字段在表示 \"2.50\" 的地方显示 \"2.5\"，\n计数字段则在 \"3.0000001\" 旁边显示 \"3\"。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:OnBeginSliderMovement {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:OnBeginSliderMovement
    src   "The scrub began. Pairs with OnEndSliderMovement around a run of OnValueChanged."
