    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:OnValueChangedBP {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:OnValueChangedBP
    src   "The `<->` convention: two-way bindings synthesize their reverse route against this exact\nname, so a value control carries it alongside its spoken events. Fires with them."
    text  "`<->` 约定：双向绑定会针对这个确切的\n名称合成其反向路由，因此值控件会连同它一起携带自身事件。与它们一同触发。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:OnValueCommitted {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:OnValueCommitted
    src   "Fired when the value is COMMITTED -- a typed entry submitted, a step face clicked, a scrub let\ngo of -- as distinct from every intermediate value a drag passes through.\n\nThe distinction USpinBox draws, and the one a consumer that writes to a setting, a server or an\nundo stack actually needs: OnValueChanged fires on every frame of a drag, this fires once."
    text  "当值被提交时触发——键入的条目被提交、步进按钮被点击、拖动被松开——\n以区别于拖动经过的每一个中间值。\n\n这是USpinBox所做的区分，也是要写入设置、服务器或\n撤销栈的使用方真正需要的区分：OnValueChanged在拖动的每一帧都会触发，而此事件只触发一次。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:ScrubStartTravel {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:ScrubStartTravel
    src   "How far along the scrub axis the pointer had already come from the press when the drag was\nrecognised, in the pressed widget's local units. Every drag frame measures from here rather than\nfrom the press: SSpinBox spends the travel that decides a press is a drag on deciding it, and\nmoves the value only with what comes after."
    text  "拖动被识别时，指针从按下点沿拖动轴已经移动的距离，\n以被按下控件的局部单位计。每个拖动帧都从这里而非\n按下点起算：SSpinBox把判定按下是否为拖动所消耗的行程用在判定本身上，\n只用其后的行程来移动值。"
    state machine
}

