DreamSpinBox:SliderExponent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:SliderExponent
    src   "How the drag's distance bends into the value -- UMG's SliderExponent. One is linear; larger\nnumbers give the low end of the range more of the travel, which is what a range spanning\nseveral orders of magnitude needs to be usable at its bottom."
    text  "拖动的距离如何映射为值——即UMG的SliderExponent。1为线性；数值越大，\n行程中越多部分分配给范围低端，这正是跨越\n多个数量级的范围要在其底部保持可用所需要的。"
