DreamSpinBox:StepSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:StepSize
    src   "What one click of a step face, or one arrow key, adds or removes, before clamping. UMG calls it\nDelta, and as with Delta a zero hands the arrow keys SSpinBox's default step, which the modifier\nkeys scale (see the class comment)."
    text  "单击一次步进按钮或按一次方向键时，在钳制之前增加或减少的量。UMG将其称为\nDelta；与Delta一样，值为零时会把方向键交给SSpinBox的默认步长，并可由修饰键\n缩放（参见类注释）。"
    state machine
}

DreamSpinBox:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamSpinBox.h#DreamSpinBox:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why\nit stays editable instead of being gated on the enum: the old edit condition greyed the\nexact values that were driving the control."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 如此指定且确实存在样式表时，\n项目样式表优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这就是实际生效的外观——因此\n它保持可编辑，而不是由枚举控制：旧的编辑条件恰恰把\n正在驱动控件的那些值置灰了。"
    state machine
}

